Add chrome://spaces-internals, a debugging page for the smoke test.

Prints the profile's spaces and every tab's space as JSON, and takes
chrome.send() messages to add a space, assign, close and reopen tabs, and
rewrite the session file. devutils/spaces_smoke.mjs drives it to check that
tabs keep their space across restarts. Only available while HeliumSpaces is
enabled.

